 464  * Defining variables
 465  Positive Variables
 466  vteste(ipipe)
 467  q_edge(iedge)     volumetric flow rate
 468  k_edge(iedge)     massic flow rate
 469  f_pu(ipump,s)     pump head
 470  f_pi(ipipe,n)     pipe head loss per subsection
 471  f_he(ihe)         heat exchanger head loss
 472  q_circ(icirc)     volumetric flow rate per circuit
 473  lvalve(icirc)     valve head loss
 474  cpipe             annualized capital cost of the pipe sections
 475  cpump             annualized capital cost for the pumping system
 476  cpen              annualized overall penalization due higher outlet temper
      ature of hot fluid
 477  cope              overall operating cost of a pump
 478  cr(ihe)           heat capacity ratio
 479  U(ihe)            overall heat transfer coefficient
 480  h_w(ihe)          convection heat transfer coefficient of water
 481  h_hot(ihe)        convection heat transfer coefficient of hot fluid
 482  NTU(ihe)          number of transfer units
 483  epsilon(ihe)      effectiveness of a counter-current flow heat exchanger
 484  k_he_hot(ihe)     mass flow rate of hot fluid in heat exchanger
 485  T_w_feed          water temperature at cooling tower inlet
 486  T_w_base          water temperature at cooling tower outlet
 487  T_w_in(ihe)       water temperature at heat exchanger inlet
 488  T_w_out(ihe)      water temperature at heat exchanger outlet
 489  T_hot_out(ihe)    hot fluid temperature at heat exchanger outlet
 490  che(ihe)          financial loss
 491  IM                integral of Merkel
 492  Ip                characteristic curve of the tower
